# HOME held + a knob turned: that knob back to its default, on any page (a filter: off; a pan: the centre; an effect's
# knob: the effect's; a track's parameter: tp_info's; a master value: a new project's), said on the screen and by the
# reader; Arrange's KNOB 1 still the tempo's tenths. The centre catch: the three master filters and a pan turned
# through the middle stop there and hold for two detents (a pause lets go; MIDI lands where it says)
wait 300
listen
# the master filter: the melodic group's to a low-pass, then HOME + KNOB 2: off
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Master_filter
spin K2 -20
expect mst.melf 44
press HOME
wait 40
shot reset_hint.png
spin K2 1
wait 40
shot reset_said.png
release HOME
expect mst.melf 64
said melodic
expect page Master_filter
# the resonance: 0
spin K4 50
press HOME
spin K4 -3
release HOME
expect mst.fres 0
# Master out's comp: a new project's 30
turn SELECT 1
expect page Master_out
spin K3 20
expect mst.comp 50
press HOME
spin K3 1
release HOME
expect mst.comp 30
said comp
# Mix: T2's pan back to the centre, its level to its default
tap GLO
tap GLO
expect page Mix
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
spin K3 30
expect par2.pan 94
spin K4 -40
press HOME
spin K3 -1
spin K4 1
release HOME
expect par2.pan 64
expect par2.level 100
said pan
# an effect's knob: drive on T2's Insert 1, its amount turned, back to drive's own (64)
tap FX
expect page Insert_1
turn PRESET 1
expect par2.ctype 1
spin K1 30
expect par2.camt 94
press HOME
spin K1 1
release HOME
expect par2.camt 64
said amount
# a sound's parameter: EDIT's first knob back to tp_info's
tap ENV
spin K1 40
press HOME
spin K1 1
release HOME
expect par2.a 0
# Arrange: HOME + KNOB 1 still the tempo's tenths (no reset)
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
press HOME
spin K1 3
release HOME
wait 40
expect tempo 120
spin K1 3
wait 40
expect tempo 123
# the centre catch: the drums' filter from 65 down a detent at a time: 64, held for two, then on
tap GLO
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Master_filter
mst dfilt 65
spin K1 -1
expect mst.dfilt 64
spin K1 -1
expect mst.dfilt 64
spin K1 -1
expect mst.dfilt 64
spin K1 -1
expect mst.dfilt 63
# a sweep through the middle in one turn: there, held, then through
mst mfilt 90
spin K3 -40
expect mst.mfilt 64
spin K3 -40
expect mst.mfilt 64
spin K3 -40
expect mst.mfilt 64
spin K3 -40
expect mst.mfilt 24
# a pause: let go at once
mst melf 66
spin K2 -2
expect mst.melf 64
wait 500
spin K2 -1
expect mst.melf 63
# MIDI (CC 30, absolute) lands where it says
midi BA 1E 41
wait 20
expect mst.dfilt 65
# a pan: through the centre, held two detents
tap GLO
tap GLO
expect page Mix
param 2 pan 66
spin K3 -5
expect par2.pan 64
spin K3 -1
expect par2.pan 64
spin K3 -1
expect par2.pan 64
spin K3 -1
expect par2.pan 63
